    <string name="how_text">1. Link the phones once with a shared 17-character key.\n2. When you want to grant time, choose the child and minutes.\n3. Box creates a 9-digit code signed with the key (HMAC-SHA256); it can\'t be forged without the key.\n4. The child enters it in Хранитоникс and the time is added instantly, offline.\nA code is valid for 24 hours and only once.</string>
    <string name="how_title">How it works</string>
    <string name="intro_text">Choose a child and how much time to add. Tell the code by phone or send it by SMS — no internet needed.</string>
    <string name="intro_text_empty">Add a child: enter the key from Хранитоникс on the child\'s phone, or create a key here and enter it there.</string>
